        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Twelve-symbol dragon robe of silk tapestry (<i>kesi</i>). Design of the three elements, 9 large 5-clawed dragons pursuing sacred discs among clouds, the 12 symbols, bat swastikas etc; red, pink, shades of blue and gold on yellow ground. Collar and cuffs of similar design on dark blue ground. Lined with blue silk."@en , "Dragon robe, silk tapestry (<i>kesi</i>), China, Qing dynasty, 19th century."@en ;
